<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ECC" style="id">- Zigua Bible Version</book>
  <para style="toc3">Mlongi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mlongi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Chitabu cha Mlong</para>
  <para style="mt1">CHITABU CHA</para>
  <para style="mt2">MLONGI</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongozi</para>
  <para style="ip">Mlongi ni chitabu chikuhinya ubala mo wikazi mwe isi. Zina dye chitabu chino kwa Chiebulanita ni kugamba, Mntu akuchisanya wantu. Wata kuwasoma walozize wazumila kugamba seuta Solomoni nuyo awandike ichitabu chino, mna awamwega ivyo hawakuvizumila. Solomoni awandika ichitabu chino, chawandikagwa mwe mihilimo ya 970 kubula 931 Kulisito henati kwelekwa, Solomoni ekalaga mwe ichipindi icho, elo numo awandikaga ichitabu chino. Mna wata kuwasoma watuhu wazumila kugamba chawandikagwa ni mntu mtuhu, kwaviya chipindi icho wajeseza longa dya chitumwa ukaleka longa dya chiseuta Mlongi 5:8 kubula msitale wa 9. Wata kusoma awo wafanyanya kugamba chitabu cha mlongi chawandikagwa chikale Solomoni henati, mafani mwe mihilimo ya 400 kubula 200 Kulisito henati kwelekwa.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mlongi akonga kwa kugamba ujima ni saviya mpeho ikusunguza kusika mwe sula ya 1:2. Ni kugamba ujima wetu ne ndima zetu ni za chipindi du naho ni vidala kukombaganya. Mbuli zilozize mwe izo zasunguza kujalwa chipindi chijihi chinajinka. Mbuli zilozize hazimuli mo udahi wetu. Ni vyedi kuzumila ujima enga ivyo wili na kulonda mbwedo mwe viya unanavyo mwe suala ya 9:9. Udumo ichitabu chatambalisa kugamba mo wikazi kuna udala na mbwedo mna chintu cha nkongo ni kumogoha Chohile na kutimila imiko yakwe mwe sula ya 12:13.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yemndani mwe chitabu cha Mlongi. 1. Msitale wa 1 kubula 11 mwe sula ya 1 Mlongi amtambalisa mta kuwandika ichitabu cha Mlongi na vimwenga ivyo ahinile mo ujima. 2. 1:12 kubula sula ya 6:9 Iviya chitabu mwe chitabu chino atambalisa mana yo ujima wakwe. 3. Sula ya 6:10 kubula 12:8 iviya mlongi alavya ulangilizi wa Mhinya. 4. Udumo Sula ya 12 msitale wa 9 kubula 14 akomeleza ichitabu kwa kugamba mbuli zose mo ujima ni kumvikila Chohile na kutimila imiko yakwe.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ECC 1" />
  <para style="s">Ujima uno ni wa bule</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 1:1" />Ino ikutimila ni milosi ya Mlongi mwana ywa Daudi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 1:1">uyo Daudi endaga seuta uko Yelusalemu.<verse eid="ECC 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 1:2" />Ni vyabule, ni vyabule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 1:2">nakugambila miye mlongi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 1:2">Ujima ni wa bule du.<verse eid="ECC 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 1:3" />Mntu abweda mbwani mwe indima yakwe yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 1:3">akwangadikila muno mwe isi?<verse eid="ECC 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 1:4" />Vyeleko vyeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 1:4">vyeleko vyajinka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 1:4">mna isi yekala kale na kale.<verse eid="ECC 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 1:5" />Zuwa dyatontomoka, naho dyaswa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 1:5">nadyo mtondo ukutimila dyasunguza kuya vituhu ko kusomwela.<verse eid="ECC 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 1:6" />Mpeho yavumila kuhinga kwamwenyemzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 1:6">vijkaheza yahitukila chenya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 1:6">yavumila chila ntendele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 1:6">vikaheza yakonga vituhu mwe sila yakwe.<verse eid="ECC 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 1:7" />Imito yose yagulusa mazi kuhinga kwe ibahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 1:7">hata ivyo ibahali hayajezaga kumema mpwii.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 1:7">Amazi yauya ukudya imito ikukongela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 1:7">na kukonga vituhu.<verse eid="ECC 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 1:8" />Mbuli zose zamtenda mntu asokele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 1:8">usokezi hwikudaha kuutambalisa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 1:8">Ziso hadikusokela kusinya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 1:8">gutwi nadyo hadikusokela kwiva.<verse eid="ECC 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 1:9" />Chiya chiyaho nicho nachitende chiyaho vituhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 1:9">chiya chidamanyike nicho nachidamanyike vituhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 1:9">muno mwe isi hamna chintu chihya.<verse eid="ECC 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 1:10" />Wantu wagamba, “Kaula ino ni mbuli mpya!”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 1:10">Mna bule yendaga iyuko kukongela chikale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 1:10">chikale hachinati kwelekwa.<verse eid="ECC 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 1:11" />Hahana mntu akukumbuka mbuli za wantu wa chikale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 1:11">hata wadya hewenati kwiza hawakumbukwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 1:11">ni wadya nawatimile nyumani.<verse eid="ECC 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ivyo akuwona mlongi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 1:12" />Miye mlongi nendaga seuta ywa Izulaeli uko Yelusalemu.<verse eid="ECC 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 1:13" />Sijeseza chipindi changu chose kuhina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 1:13">na kubunkula kwa umanyi wose zikudamanyika hasi he imbingu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 1:13">Chohile kawenka wantu mzigo uzamise, ukuhosa wasulumizwe.<verse eid="ECC 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 1:14" />Siwona izimbuli zose zikudamanyika muno mwe isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 1:14">zose izo ni za bule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 1:14">vyose ni saviya kubalaza nkung'unto.<verse eid="ECC 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 1:15" />Chintu chigonjize hachikudahika kugololwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 1:15">chiya hechihali hachikudahika kuwazwa.<verse eid="ECC 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 1:16" />Elo, niyo nafanyanya na kugamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 1:16">“Sipata ubala ulozese kujinka wose walongoze Yelusalemu umo miye sinati</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 1:16">Simanyisa vintu vilozese kujinka viya wadamanyaga.”<verse eid="ECC 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 1:17" />Aho niyo nakombaganya kwesima mwe ubala na uhezi na kubwalata,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 1:17">mna niyo nabunkula idyo nadya ni saviya kubalaza nkung'unto.<verse eid="ECC 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 1:18" />Kwaviya ubala utendese waleta nkama ikulise,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 1:18">umanyi ukongezekela, chinyulu nacho chongezekela.<verse eid="ECC 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ECC 2" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 2:1" />Niyo nelongela mo umoyo wangu, goja nidamanye chila chintu nachinibwedeze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 2:1">mna niyo nawona ni vyabule.<verse eid="ECC 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 2:2" />Niyo nabunkula kugamba luseko nalo ni lwabule, ukebwedeza wachumilwa chibwani.<verse eid="ECC 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 2:3" />Niyo najeza kwebwedeza kwa divai na kudamanya mbuli za chihezi, kuno umoyo wangu uchei wanilongoza kwa ubala. Nahaunga niwone ni chihi chedi wantu wakungwa wadamanye kwa mazuwa majeche wakwikala muno mwe isi.<verse eid="ECC 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 2:4" />Niyo nadamanya mbuli zikulise, sizenga mazumba na kulima nkonde za mizabiu.<verse eid="ECC 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 2:5" />Niyo nadamanya chibuta na viwasa vya kwebwedeza, sihoteza miti yesimane ya matunda.<verse eid="ECC 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 2:6" />Niyo nazenga mabwawa ya kuchisanyiza mazi ya kuinywesa iyo imiti ikule vyedi.<verse eid="ECC 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 2:7" />Niyo nagula watumwa wachigosi na wachiche na watumwa watuhu welekwa mnyumba mwangu. Iviya nendile nna mafyo ya ng'ombe na ngoto na mbuzi kujinka mntu yoyose ekalaga komzi wa Yelusalemu umo miye sinati.<verse eid="ECC 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 2:8" />Niyo nechisanyiza mayuwe ya chumbu na zahabu kulawa mwe izihazina za maseuta na kulawa mwe imikowa, niyo napata wachemi wa chilume na wachiche na wasuntaviya wanibwedeze vitendese.<verse eid="ECC 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 2:9" />Niyo namanyikisa kujinka mntu yoyose ekalaga komzi wa Yelusalemu miye sinati. Hamwenga na yose ayo niyo natenda no ubala utendese.<verse eid="ECC 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 2:10" />Sipata chila chintu nungile, hahana chintu chedi ninyimile umoyo wangu. Umoyo welelwa mwe izindima zangu, ayo yendaga majeleko ye izindima nidamanye.<verse eid="ECC 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 2:11" />Vikaheza niyo nafanyanya mwe vyose nidamanye, neivyo ntumbwadike hadamanya izindima izo. Niyo nabunkula vyose ivyo ni vyabule, ni saviya kubalaza nkung'unto, hehana kuchumilwa kokose hasi he imbingu.<verse eid="ECC 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 2:12" />Elo, niyo nakonga kufanyanya mana ya kutenda na ubala na kutenda dibwalate na kutenda hezi. Niyo neuza, “Seuta mhya neze natende chintu chani hechidamanywe ni maseuta wajinkile.”<verse eid="ECC 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 2:13" />Niyo nabunkula kugamba ubala ni wedi ukaleka uhezi, saviya ulangazi wi wedi ukaleka chiza.<verse eid="ECC 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 2:14" />Mntu mta ubala ajeseza ubala wakwe saviya mta meso adaha kuwona kudya akwita, mna mhezi ni saviya tuntu hakuwona kudya akwita. Mna niyo nawona kugamba wose waligana uhelo wawo numwe.<verse eid="ECC 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 2:15" />Niyo nafanyanya mo umoyo wangu, “Izimbuli nazimbwile mntu mhezi, iviya zadaha kunibwila hata miye. Elo nanibwede mbwani kwa kutenda no ubala?” Niyo nehitula mo umoyo wangu, “Vyose ivyo ni vyabule.”<verse eid="ECC 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 2:16" />Kwaviya kwa mntu mta ubala, enga viya vili kwa mntu mhezi, hakumbukwe kwa chipindi chitali, mwa amazuwa yakwiza wose nawajalwe. Saviya vili kwa mntu mhezi, mntu mta ubala iviya naye nabanike.<verse eid="ECC 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 2:17" />Elo, niyo nawihiwa ujima wangu, kwaviya ndima zikudamanyika muno mwe isi zaniholoza. Vyose ivyo ni vyabule ni saviya kubalaza nkung'unto.<verse eid="ECC 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 2:18" />Niyo nehiwa chila ndima nidamanye muno mwe isi, kwaviya umo habanika vyaungwa nimwasize yudya akwiza.<verse eid="ECC 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ECC 2:19" />Ni yuhi amanyize kugamba natende ni mta ubala hegu mhezi? Mna uyo nuyo naguhe vyose nidamanye hajeseza ubala hano he isi. Iviya ivyo vyose ni vyabule.<verse eid="ECC 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ECC 2:20" />Elo, nize nifanyanye vituhu mwe izindima zangu nidamanye muno mwe isi, niyo nafa chevu.<verse eid="ECC 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ECC 2:21" />Kwaviya mntu adaha kudamanya ndima yakwe kwa ubala na umanyi na untanda, mna uhelo wakwe aungwa amwasiza mntu mtuhu hevidamanyize ndima. Vyose ivyo ni vyabule naho ni mbuli ihise.<verse eid="ECC 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ECC 2:22" />Mntu napate chibwani mwe nkunto zose na kuhikiliza kwangadika mwe ndima akutumbwazikila muno mwe isi?<verse eid="ECC 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ECC 2:23" />Kwaviya wikazi wakwe wose umema nkunto, ne izindima zakwe ni kwangadika ukodu, hata nechilo akili yakwe haikuhumula. Ivyo vyose ni vyabule.<verse eid="ECC 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ECC 2:24" />Hakuna chintu chedi chikumwambiza mntu, ukaleka kudya na kunywa na kwenenwa mwe indima yakwe. Hata icho nawaona chalawa kwa Chohile.<verse eid="ECC 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ECC 2:25" />Kwaviya hunenkigwe ni Chohile, hukudaha kupata nkande hegu kwebwedeza.<verse eid="ECC 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ECC 2:26" />Mntu akumuwagila Chohile, Chohile amwinka ubala na umanyi na mbwedo, mna kwa mntu mwavu, Chohile amwinka ndima ya kuchisanya na kwika ugoli vileke Chohile amwinke yudya akunga. Vyose ivyo ni vyabule, ni saviya kubalaza nkung'unto.<verse eid="ECC 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ECC 3" />
  <para style="s">Chila mbuli ina chipindi chakwe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 3:1" />Chila chintu chikulaila hano he isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 3:1">chalaila kwa chipindi chakwe.<verse eid="ECC 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 3:2" />Kuna chipindi cha kwelekwa, iviya kuna chipindi cha kubanika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 3:2">chipindi cha kuhanda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 3:2">iviya kuna chipindi cha kung'ola vihandigwe,<verse eid="ECC 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 3:3" />Kuna chipindi cha kukoma, iviya kuna chipindi cha kuhonya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 3:3">kuna chipindi cha kubogozola, iviya kuna chipindi cha kuzenga,<verse eid="ECC 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 3:4" />Kuna chipindi cha kwila na chipindi cha kuseka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 3:4">chipindi cha kulomboleza na chipindi cha kuseziga,<verse eid="ECC 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 3:5" />Kuna chipindi cha kumwaganisa mayuwe, iviya kuna chipindi cha kuyachisanya chani uyajeseze ndima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 3:5">chipindi cha kukubatila, iviya kuna chipindi cha kuleka kukubatila,<verse eid="ECC 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 3:6" />Kuna chipindi cha kulonda, iviya kuna chipindi cha kwaza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 3:6">chipindi cha kwika, iviya kuna chipindi cha kudula,<verse eid="ECC 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 3:7" />Kuna chipindi cha kumolola, iviya kuna chipindi cha kusuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 3:7">chipindi cha kunyamala, iviya kuna chipindi cha kutamwila,<verse eid="ECC 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 3:8" />Kuna chipindi cha kunga, iviya kuna chipindi cha kwihiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 3:8">chipindi cha nkondo na chipindi cha utondowazi.<verse eid="ECC 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 3:9" />Mndima achumilwa chibwani kulawana no kuhikiliza kwakwe uko?<verse eid="ECC 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 3:10" />Miye siwona ndima ndala enkigwe mntu ni Chohile. Ikumhosa etumbwadise vitendese.<verse eid="ECC 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 3:11" />Chohile kakitenda chila chintu chitende chedi kwa chipindi chakwe. Kamwinka mntu kubesa kumanya mbuli nazilaile, mna hamwinkile luhenyo lwa kukombaganya ntendwa za Chohile kukongela nkongo kubula uhelo.<verse eid="ECC 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 3:12" />Simanya kugamba hahana chintu chedi kwa mntu ukaleka kwelelwa na kutenda yedi chipindi akatenda mjima.<verse eid="ECC 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 3:13" />Naho ni ungi wa Chohile chila mntu adye na kunywa na kwesangalaza kwa yedi mwe izindima zetu chikudamanya.<verse eid="ECC 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 3:14" />Simanya kugamba chila chintu akudamanya Chohile chekala kale na kale, hakuna chikudaha kongezwa hegu kuhunguzwa. Chohile adamanya ivyo vileke wantu wamvikile yeye.<verse eid="ECC 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 3:15" />Chintu chochose chiyaho, chendaga chiyaho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 3:15">na chintu nachitende chatendekaga aho nkongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 3:15">Chohile ahosa chila chintu chilaile vituhu na vituhu.<verse eid="ECC 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uwagila mwe isi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 3:16" />Ukaleka ayo, sibunkula chintu chituhu muno mwe isi, mlamuzi asagule chiya chikuwagila, mna hantu hakwe asagula hechikuwagila, aungwa alamule vikuwagila, mna adamanya mbuli za wavu.<verse eid="ECC 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 3:17" />Mna, niyo nelongela mo umoyo, “Chohile nawakantile wose waidi, wata uwagila na wakudamanya masa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 3:17">kwaviya nakutende na chipindi kwachausa cha chila mbuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 3:17">na chipindi kwa chila ntendwa.”<verse eid="ECC 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 3:18" />Iviya niyo nelongela mo umoyo, “Chohile awajeza wantu, chani awalagise kugamba wowo we saviya wanyama.”<verse eid="ECC 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ECC 3:19" />Udumo wa wantu ni saudya wa wanyama, wose uhelo wawo uligana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 3:19">Iviya mnyama akufa nivyo mntu akufa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 3:19">Wose wana muye ukuligana, mntu hana chintu chongezekele ukaleka mnyama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 3:19">Chila chintu mwawo ni chabule.<verse eid="ECC 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ECC 3:20" />Wose waita hantu haligane, wose walawa mwe lumbi naho wose wauya mwe lumbi.<verse eid="ECC 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ECC 3:21" />Ni yuhi amanyize hegu loho ya mntu yaita kulanga na loho ya mnyama yasela hasi he sanga?<verse eid="ECC 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ECC 3:22" />Elo, niyo nabunkula kugamba hakuna mbuli yedi itendese kwa mntu kudamanya ukaleka kwelelwa ndima yakwe, kwaviya nivyo apangilwe. Ni yuhi akudaha kumgambila mntu ziya nazilaile akaheza kubanika.<verse eid="ECC 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ECC 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 4:1" />Vikaheza niyo nawona unyakwili ukudamanywa muno mwe isi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 4:1">Wantu wakubunyanywa waila mna hahana yoyose akuwambiza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 4:1">Kwaviya wadya wakuwabunyanya wana nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 4:1">nivyo vikuleka hawana ywa kuwambiza.<verse eid="ECC 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 4:2" />Elo, niyo nafanyanya mo umoyo kugamba wantu wabanike wana luhulwila ukaleka wantu wachei wajima.<verse eid="ECC 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 4:3" />Mna mta luhulwila kujinka wose awo awaidi ni yudya henati kwelekwa, yudya henati kuwona wavu ukudamanywa muno mwe isi.<verse eid="ECC 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 4:4" />Iviya niyo nabunkula kugamba kuhikiliza kose kwa mntu na udahi wakwe mwe ndima vyalawana na kuhigana, chila yumwenga aunga amjinke mnyawe. Vyose ivyo ni vyabule, ni saviya kubalaza nkung'unto.<verse eid="ECC 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 4:5" />Mntu abwalate hakunga kudamanya ndima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 4:5">elo nakomwe ni sala.<verse eid="ECC 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 4:6" />Ni vyedi kutenda na chidodo du, hamwenga na utondowazi mo umoyo, ukaleka kutenda na vilozize, hamwenga na nkunto, ni saviya kubalaza nkung'unto.<verse eid="ECC 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 4:7" />Iviya niyo nawona mbuli imwenga ya bule muno mwe isi.<verse eid="ECC 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 4:8" />Kwendaga na mntu hene mwana hegu mlukolo, hata ivyo hakuleka kudamanya ndima, akakalika mwe kulonda ugoli, hakuhema hegu kweuza namdamanyiza ndima yuhi na kwenyima kwebwedeza? Vyose ivyo ni vyabule, ni ndima yakwangadika.<verse eid="ECC 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 4:9" />Ni vyedi wantu waidi wakadamanya ndima hamwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 4:9">ukaleka mntu yumwenga akadamanya ichedu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 4:9">waidi wambizana mwe indima yawo.<verse eid="ECC 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 4:10" />Uneva yumwenga akagwa mnyawe namwinule. Mna ni mbuli ikujela usungu kwa yudya mntu echedu akugwa mna hana mntu ywa kumwinula.<verse eid="ECC 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 4:11" />Iviya uneva waidi wanagona hamwenga nawabwikanane moto.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 4:11">Mna mntu anatenda echedu adaha kwebwikanya moto vivihi?<verse eid="ECC 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 4:12" />Mntu anatenda echedu adaha kuhudwa ni mnkondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 4:12">mna wanatenda waidi nawamwebunge na kumhuda mnkondo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 4:12">Uneva sigi ntatu zinalukwa hamwenga hazikukantika vihufu.<verse eid="ECC 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 4:13" />Mbwanga mchiwa mta ubala awagila ukaleka seuta hezi adalahale, hekwetegeleza ulangilizi wedi.<verse eid="ECC 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 4:14" />Mbwanga uyo nakadaha kulawa kwe idijeleza na kupata useuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 4:14">hegu nakadaha kwelekwa mwe wachiwa, mna nyumani adaha atende seuta.<verse eid="ECC 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 4:15" />Siwawona wantu wose wekale na kujenda muno mwe isi, niyo nabunkula kugamba wamwenga mgati mwawo wadaha walongozwe ni yudya mbwanga ahokele useuta.<verse eid="ECC 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 4:16" />Wantu walozize wamtunya saviya seuta, mna wadya naweze nyumani hawamwelelwe. Niyo nabunkula kugamba mbuli zose izo ni zabule, ni kubalaza nkung'unto.<verse eid="ECC 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ECC 5" />
  <para style="s">Kaulisa umo ukaika cheliso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 5:1" />Ukaulise umo ukaita Kwenyumba ya Chohile, sogela vileke wetegelezese ukaleka kulavya ntambiko saviya wakulavya wahezi, wantu hewemanyize kusenta dyedi na dihiye. <verse eid="ECC 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 5:2" />Fanyanya hwinati kulonga, usekutenda mhufu ywa kwika ndagano kwa Chohile, kwaviya Chohile ekwembingu weye wi mweisi. Elo, usekulongesa. <verse eid="ECC 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 5:3" />Mntu akangadikisa mwe ndima nivyo nalote sozi, mntu akulongesa alonga uhezi. <verse eid="ECC 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 5:4" />Unaika nazili yako kwa Chohile usekukawa kuichintiza. Uyo hakuwelelwa wantu wahezi. Chintiza inazili yako. <verse eid="ECC 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 5:5" />Ni vyedi usekwika nazili, ukaleka kwika niyo hukuichintiza. <verse eid="ECC 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 5:6" />Ukalonga kaulisa unasekulonga mbuli za masa, naho usekwegombela kwa mlavtyantambiko, ukagamba, miye sika nazili mna silonga du. Ni mbwani umtende Chohile akwiihiwe mwe mbuli ukulonga na kubalanga ndima udamanye? <verse eid="ECC 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 5:7" />Kulota sozi zilozese na kulongesa ni vyabule. Chintu cha mana ni kumtunya na kumwiva Chohile.<verse eid="ECC 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wikazi mwe isi ni wabule</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 5:8" />Usekwehelwa ukawona mwe isi wantu wachiwa wabunyanywa, hawakwinkwa uwagila wawo na maliho yawo. Chila sekulu akuwabunyanya wachiwa atimiza lagizo enkigwe ni mtuhu, mwa awo wose waidi kuna mkulu awajinkile wose. <verse eid="ECC 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 5:9" />Kuchumilwa kwa wantu mwe isi ni kwachausa cha wantu wose, hata seuta mwenye adya vikulawa kwezinkonde. <verse eid="ECC 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 5:10" />Mntu akungisa hela, hela hazimchinte, akungisa ugoli hajeze kuchintiza mwe chiya akupata. Ivyo navyo ni vyabule. <verse eid="ECC 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 5:11" />Ugoli ukajenyela, nivyo wakudya nawo wakujenyela, elo mgoli hakuchumilwa, ukaleka kuusinya ugoli wakwe du ivyo ukusunguza kwaga. <verse eid="ECC 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 5:12" />Mchibaluwa agona ntongo zimwile chilo chose, atenda hadilise hegu kadilisa. Mna mgoli afanyanya ugoli wakwe du, elo ntongo hazikwiza. <verse eid="ECC 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 5:13" />Naho siwona mbuli imwenga ntuhu ihise muno mwe isi. Mntu anechisanyiza ugoli mna haukumwambiza dyodyose akatenda mwe nkunto. <verse eid="ECC 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 5:14" />Chintu chihise chadaha kulaila umo anabanika, uhelo wakwe mntu uyo wanawe hawasize ugoli wowose. <verse eid="ECC 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 5:15" />Mntu elekwa akatenda mwazi, iviya ezile nivyo nahalawe. Hakuguha chochose kulawana ne izindima zakwe adamanye. <verse eid="ECC 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 5:16" />Ino nayo ni mbuli ihise. Mntu nauye seiviya ezile. Ketumbwadisa akabalaza nkung'unto na kulawa mluche wa bule. <verse eid="ECC 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 5:17" />Mna hata hegu mntu ni mgoli, nkande zakwe hakuzibweda, wikazi wakwe wose wamema nkunto na masulumizo na maya na manyonje. <verse eid="ECC 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 5:18" />Niyo nabunkula kugamba, chintu chedi chiligane mwe mntu ni kudya na kunywa na kwelelwa mwe chiya akupata mwe izindima zakwe akudamanya hano he isi, mwa amazuwa ayo majeche enkigwe ni Chohile yo kwikala muno mwe isi, kwaviya nivyo ekiwe. <verse eid="ECC 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ECC 5:19" />Uneva Chohile anamwinka mntu ugoli na vintu vilozese na kumwinka luhenyo lwa kwebwedeza mwe ivyo apatile mwe izindima zakwe ndala, mntu uyo amhongeze Chohile. Idyo ni jeleko kulawa kwa Chohile. <verse eid="ECC 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ECC 5:20" />Kwaviya Chohile kamleka mntu atende na mbwedo, elo, mntu hatende na nkama itendese mo wikazi wakwe mjihi.<verse eid="ECC 5:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ECC 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 6:1" />Siwona mbuli ntuhu ihise hano he isi, iyo yawahosa wantu watende na nkunto itendese. <verse eid="ECC 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 6:2" />Chohile adaha kumwinka ugoli utendese na vintu vilozize na ntunyo, asekuhungukilwa ni chintu chochose akunga. Mna Chohile hakumlekeila avibwede ivintu ivyo. Hantu hakwe vintu vyose ivyo vyabwedwa ni mjeni. Vyose ivyo ni vya bule, ni mbuli ikulumiza vidala. <verse eid="ECC 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 6:3" />Mntu adaha kweleka wana gana dimwenga, adaha ekale mihilimo ilozize, mna havinani hata akekala chipindi chitali vivihi, uneva hakubweda upati wakwe na umo anabanika hakuhambwa kwa ntunyo, miye nagamba mwana elekwe na kubanika ana ntunyo ukaleka mntu uyo. <verse eid="ECC 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 6:4" />Mwana elekwe na kubanika ni ywa bule, agila mwe chiza na kujalwa. <verse eid="ECC 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 6:5" />Hata hegu mwana uyo hajezize kuwona idizuwa hegu kumanya chintu chochose, mwana uyo ana ntulwe ukaleka umntu uyo. <verse eid="ECC 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 6:6" />Hatahegu uyo mntu nekale mihilimo elufu mbili na kongezeza, mna kadunduga kubweda upati wakwe, mntu uyo ni saviya yudya mwana, wose waidi waita hantu hamwenga. <verse eid="ECC 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 6:7" />Mntu ahikiliza kudamanya ndima vileke apate nkande, mna umelo wakwe wa kudya haukuchintizwa mpwii. <verse eid="ECC 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 6:8" />Togola mntu mta ubala ana luhulwila ukaleka mntu mhezi? Na mntu mchiwa apata chibwani anamanya kuchumilwa mo wikazi wakwe? <verse eid="ECC 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 6:9" />Vyose ivyo ni vyabule, ni saviya kubalaza nkung'nto, ni vyedi kuchintizwa mwe chiya unanacho, ukaleka kutumbwazika kumeila mate chintu chituhu. <verse eid="ECC 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 6:10" />Chila chintu chikulaila nachipangwa kale aho nkongo, ivyo eli mntu vimanyika, chimanya kugamba mntu msokezi hakudaha kuhigana na mta nguvu. <verse eid="ECC 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 6:11" />Milosi ilozize haina loso, iyo haikumwambiza mntu. <verse eid="ECC 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 6:12" />Ni yuhi amanyize chikumuwagila mntu mo wikazi uno mjihi, ujima ukujinka saviya chizuli? Ni yuhi muno mweisi amanyize icho nachimlaile mntu anabanika?<verse eid="ECC 6:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ECC 7" />
  <para style="s">Milosi ikwambiza mo wikazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 7:1" />Ntogozi ni yedi ukaleka mavuta yakupwepweleka. Zuwa dya kubanika ni dyedi ukaleka zuwa dya kwelekwa. <verse eid="ECC 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 7:2" />Vyawagila ukaita kwe nyumba ina uchiwa, ukaleka kwita kwe nyumba ya ngasu, kwaviya file yambwila chila mntu, wata ujima waifanyanye imbuli iyo. <verse eid="ECC 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 7:3" />Chinyulu ni chedi ukaleka luseko, kwaviya chinyulu chakutenda uhine dyokutenda. <verse eid="ECC 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 7:4" />Moyo wa mta ubala wafanyanya mwe nyumba yo uchiwa, mna moyo wa mhezi wafanyanya mbwedo. <verse eid="ECC 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 7:5" />Ni vyedi kwiva mafundo ya wantu wata ubala, ukaleka kwetegeleza nchemo za wantu wahezi. <verse eid="ECC 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 7:6" />Kwaviya luseko lwa mntu mhezi ni saviya mwilo wa miwa ikutatalika mwe moto. Vyose ivyo ni vyabule. <verse eid="ECC 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 7:7" />Kubunyanya kwamtenda mntu mta ubala atende hezi, kuhokela fumbaso kwabalanga fanyanyi za mntu. <verse eid="ECC 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 7:8" />Udumo wa mbuli ni wedi ukaleka nkongelo yakwe, ujijimizi ni wedi ukaleka kweduvya. <verse eid="ECC 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 7:9" />Usekutenda mhufu ywa kwihiwa mo umoyo wako, kwaviya maya yekala mwe wantu wahezi. <verse eid="ECC 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 7:10" />Usekuza, “Kwambwani mazuwa yomboke ni yedi ukaleka ya haluse?” Izo sizo fanyanyi zedi ukauza ivyo. <verse eid="ECC 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 7:11" />Ubala ni saviya ulisi, ni chintu chedi, wawambiza wantu wata ujima. <verse eid="ECC 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 7:12" />Kudimwa nu ubala ni saviya kudimwa ni hela, mna wedi wa umanyi ni kugamba wadima ujima wa mntu ananawo. <verse eid="ECC 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 7:13" />Fanyanya chiya adamanye Chohile, ni yuhi akudaha kugolola chintu chigonjezwe ni Chohile? <verse eid="ECC 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 7:14" />Mazuwa ya kuchumilwa welelwe, mazuwa ya nkunto yakeza fanyanye izimbuli izo, kuchumilwa na nkunto vyo vidamanywa ni Chohile vileke mntu asekumanya icho nachilaile nyumani. <verse eid="ECC 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 7:15" />Mo wikazi wangu uno wa bule, siwona chila chintu, mntu ywedi abanika mo wedi wakwe, na mntu mwavu ajendeleza kwikala. <verse eid="ECC 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 7:16" />Elo, usekutenda mkanuni vitendese, naho usekutenda mta ubala vitendese! Ni mbwani wekome mwenye? <verse eid="ECC 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 7:17" />Usekutenda mwavu vitendese, naho usekutenda hezi, unase kubanika chipindi chako hechinati. <verse eid="ECC 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 7:18" />Waungwa utoze yose maidi dya nkongo na dyakaidi, kwaviya akumtunya Chohile achumilwa mwe ayo. <verse eid="ECC 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ECC 7:19" />Ubala wamtenda mntu ananawo atende na nguvu kujinka vilongozi mlongo umwenga mo mzi. <verse eid="ECC 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ECC 7:20" />Hahana mntu mta uwagila muno mweisi, akutenda yedi mazuwa yose, asekujeza kukola masa. <verse eid="ECC 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ECC 7:21" />Usekujela momtwi chila mbuli ikulongwa ni wantu, hegu sivyo, wadaha kumwiva mndima ywako akakuligita, <verse eid="ECC 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ECC 7:22" />kwaviya kuvimanya mo umoyo wako kugamba, kuligita weyawo nkanana zilozize. <verse eid="ECC 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ECC 7:23" />Mbuli zose izo sizihima kwa ubala, niyo nawona kugamba nna ubala, mna ubala wi hale vidala na miye. <verse eid="ECC 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ECC 7:24" />Mntu adaha kubunkula vivihi ujima, mbuli iyo ni ndala kwetu kuikombaganya. <verse eid="ECC 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ECC 7:25" />Hata ivyo, niyo nekamba nimanye na kuzuza na kulonda ubala we izimbuli ziyuko, naho nikombaganye wavu nu uhezi iviya uchilalu ni kubwalata. <verse eid="ECC 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ECC 7:26" />Mbuli imwenga nibunkule ihise kujinka file, mvyele esaviya mtego na lwavu, mikono yakwe ni minyolo. Mntu akumunga Chohile namwenege uyo mvyele, mna mvyele agwiza wata masa. <verse eid="ECC 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ECC 7:27" />Mbuli zino nakugambila miye mlongi, nivyo nibunkule nize nizuzise, nahaunga nimanye kwambwani izimbuli izo zalaila. <verse eid="ECC 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ECC 7:28" />Sekamba nibunkule izimbuli izo vituhu na vituhu, mna sidunduga. Mgati mwa wagosi elufu imwenga sipata yumwenga mkanuni, mna hamna mvyele mkanuni mgati mwa wavyele elufu imwenga. <verse eid="ECC 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ECC 7:29" />Icho nicho nibunkule, Chohile kaumba wantu wakanuni, mna wantu welondela wenye mbuli zikuwazaganya.<verse eid="ECC 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ECC 8" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 8:1" />Ni yuhi akwinga mntu mta ubala?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 8:1">Ni yuhi amanyize ivyo ivintu vili?,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 8:1">Ubala wamtenda mntu amunyemunye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 8:1">wakukiza uso wa mta chinyulu.<verse eid="ECC 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwiveni seuta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 8:2" />Timila umwiko wa seuta, kwaviya nakwelisa kwa Chohile. <verse eid="ECC 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 8:3" />Usekusunguza kuhalawa halongozi ha seuta. Usekujendeleza kudamanya dihiye, kwaviya seuta adamanya diya akunga. <verse eid="ECC 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 8:4" />Kwaviya ulosi wa seuta nuwo uno ulamuzi wo udumo, hahana akudaha kumgamba ahituile ulamuzi wakwe. <verse eid="ECC 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 8:5" />Mntu yoyose akutimila lagizo dya seuta hapate dihiye, mta ubala amanya chipindi chiligane na sila iligane mwe kudamanya mbuli. <verse eid="ECC 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 8:6" />Kwaviya chila chintu china chipindi chakwe chiligane na sila zakwe, hata hegu mntu achintana na mabuli madala. <verse eid="ECC 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 8:7" />Kwaviya hahana mntu amanyize icho nachilaile nyumani, elo hahana akudaha kuchigambila icho nachilaile. <verse eid="ECC 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 8:8" />Hakuna mntu akudaha kutoza umoyo wakwe vileke asekubanika, hakuna mta udahi mwe idizuwa dyakwe dyo kubanika. Hakuna mgomba nkondo akudaha kuhona chipindi cha nkondo, wavu haukudaha kumwambula mntu mwavu.<verse eid="ECC 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wantu wavu na wakanuni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 8:9" />Vyose ivyo siviwona vyalaila muno mwe isi. Sifanyanyisa izimbuli izo, siwona kugamba wantu awamwenga wajeseza izinguvu zawo kusulumiza watuhu. <verse eid="ECC 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 8:10" />Naho siwona wantu wavu wakahambwa, wadya wazwele kwingila na kufosa hantu ho kuvikila na kwinkwa ntunyo mwe mzi udya wendile wadamanya ayo, Idyo nadyo ni dya bule. <verse eid="ECC 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 8:11" />Kwaviya wihi haukusunguza kukantilwa, elo, myoyo ya wantu yamema myalo ya kudamanya yehiye. <verse eid="ECC 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 8:12" />Hata mntu mwavu akola masa nkanana gana dimwenga na kujendeleza kwikalisa no ujima chipindi chitali, simanya kugamba navitende vyedi kwa wantu wakumogoha na kumvikila Chohile. <verse eid="ECC 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 8:13" />Mna kwaviya wantu wavu hawakumogoha Chohile hawachumilwe. Awo nawasunguze kubanika, ujima wawo hautende mtali kwaviya hawakumvikila Chohile. <verse eid="ECC 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 8:14" />Kuna mbuli imwenga ya bule nibunkule hano he isi, wantu wakanuni wadamanyizwa yadya yakuwawagila wantu wavu, na wantu wavu wadamanyizwa yadya yakuwawagila wantu wakanuni. Idyo nadyo nagamba ni dya bule. <verse eid="ECC 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 8:15" />Elo, natambalisa kugamba mntu aungwa elelwa mo ujima wakwe, kwaviya muno mwe si hamna chipindi chedi kujinka kudya na kunywa na kwelelwa. Ivyo nivyo akudaha kudamanya mntu akajesa izindima zakwe mwe ichipindi cho ujima wakwe enkigwe ni Chohile hano he isi. <verse eid="ECC 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 8:16" />Sijezesa vitendese nitende mbala, nahaunga nimanye izimbuli wantu wakudamanya muno mwe isi. Wantu hawakugona chilo na msi, <verse eid="ECC 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 8:17" />vikaheza niyo nawona indima yose ya Chohile, mntu hakudaha kumanya ndima ikudamanyika mwe isi. Wata ubala wadaha kwetenda hambwe wamanya, mna ichindedi hawamanyize.<verse eid="ECC 8:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ECC 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 9:1" />Sifanyanya mwe izimbuli zose izo, niyo nabunkula kugamba Chohile alongoza ntendwa za wantu wata ubala na wakanuni, Chohile alamula mwe mbuli wakudamanya. Hahana mntu amanyize icho nachilaile mo wikazi wawo. Wantu wamwenga wadaha wawaunge, na awamwenga wadaha wawehiwe. <verse eid="ECC 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 9:2" />Mna kuna mbuli ikulaila kwa chila mntu, wakanuni na wavu, kwa wantu wedi na wehiye, chalaila kwa wantu wakuka kwa Chohile naho vyalaila kwa wantu sawo wakuka kwa Chohile. Vyalaila kwa wantu wa kumogoha Chohile na hawakumogoha Chohile. Vyalaila kwa wantu wedi na kwa wantu wamhituke Chohile. Vyalaila kwa wadya wakwelisa na wadya hewekwelisa. <verse eid="ECC 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 9:3" />Ino ni mbuli ihise mwe mbuli zose zikulaila muno mwe isi, kugamba udumo wa ukuwapata wose numwe. Naho umo wendaga wajima awantu awo wikazi wawo wamemaga wihi na wefenyi vikaheza wabanika. <verse eid="ECC 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 9:4" />Mntu yoyose ehamwenga na wata ujima ana msuhi, kuli dina ujima dina lwedi ukaleka simba ifile. <verse eid="ECC 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 9:5" />Kwaviya wata ujima wamanya kugamba nawabanike, mna wabanike hawamanyize chochose. Hawana jeleko dyodyose, naho wajaliswa. <verse eid="ECC 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 9:6" />Ungi wawo na amaya yawo ne izitama zawo vyose vyusika hamwenga nawo, hawadamanye chochose muno mwe isi. <verse eid="ECC 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 9:7" />Hita ukadye nkande yako kwa mbwedo, ukanywe idivai yako kwa kusangala, kwaviya Chohile kaizumila kale indima yako. <verse eid="ECC 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 9:8" />Mazuwa yose vala vyedi naho kwehake mavuta komtwi. <verse eid="ECC 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 9:9" />Wikazi ni mjihi elelwa hamwenga na mkaziwo ukungisa mazuwa yose yo wikazi wako winkigwe ni Chohile, kwaviya icho nicho upangilwe mo ujima wako wa nkunto hano he isi. <verse eid="ECC 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 9:10" />Chila chintu ukunga udamanye chidamanye kwa nguvu, kwaviya uko kwedibome ukwita hakuna ndima hegu fanyanyi hegu umanyi na ubala. <verse eid="ECC 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 9:11" />Naho siwona chintu chimwenga muno mwe isi kugamba wakugulukisa hawakuhuda mwe nguluko, hegu wata nguvu kuhuda mwe nkondo, hegu wata ubala kupata nkande na wata fanyanyi zilozese kupata ugoli, hegu wata umanyi kukwezwa mo usekulu, mna mpafu yawapata wose hamwenga. <verse eid="ECC 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 9:12" />Mntu hamanyize isa yakwe naibule ini. Enga viya samaki zikugwiza mwe lwavu hezikukombaganya, saviya wadege wakugwizwa mwe mtego, nivyo wantu wakugwizwa na kugwelwa ni mabuli hewemanyize.<verse eid="ECC 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ubala ni wedi ukaleka uhezi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 9:13" />Iviya hano he isi siwona chintu atendile mntu mta ubala chinitamile vidala. <verse eid="ECC 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 9:14" />Hendaga na mzi una wekazi wajeche. Seuta mta nguvu niyo eza kuutandama hamwenga na wagomba nkondo wakwe, kemalanya vileke wawebunge. <verse eid="ECC 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 9:15" />Mo umzi uwo mwendaga na mchiwa yumwenga mta ubala akwikala umo, mo ubala wakwe kauhonya umzi uwo. Mna nyumani hahana mntu amkumbuke yudya mchiwa. <verse eid="ECC 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 9:16" />Elo, miye sibunkula kugamba ubala ni wedi ukaleka nguvu, mna ubala wa mntu mchiwa wabelwa, milosi yakwe haikwetegelezwa. <verse eid="ECC 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 9:17" />Ni vyedi kwetegeleza milosi ihoile ya mntu mta ubala, ukaleka kwetegeleza lwasu lwa seuta mwe chitala cha wahezi. <verse eid="ECC 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 9:18" />Ubala ni wedi kujinka viziha vya nkondo, mna mta masa yumwenga abalanga yedi yalozize.<verse eid="ECC 9:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ECC 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 10:1" />Ivyo si zifile zahosa mavuta ya kupwepweleka yanunke, iviya uhezi mjeche wahituila ubala na ntunyo. <verse eid="ECC 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 10:2" />Mntu mta ubala wamlongoza atende mbuli zichumile, mna mntu mhezi umoyo wakwe wamwazaganya. <verse eid="ECC 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 10:3" />Mntu mhezi hata akajenda amanyika, elagisa kwa chila mntu kugamba yeye ni mhezi. <verse eid="ECC 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 10:4" />Chilongozi anakwinukila maya, usekuhalawa he indima yako jijimiza naho mhitule mpalahole. Vikaheza nakufile mbazi. <verse eid="ECC 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 10:5" />Kuna wavu niwone muno mwe isi, ubanasi ukuhoswa ni vilongozi. <verse eid="ECC 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 10:6" />Kugamba wahezi wenkigwa ukulu mwezindima, na wagoli hawakwinkwa ukulu. <verse eid="ECC 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 10:7" />Miye siwona watumwa wakakwela falasi, kuno wakulu wakajenda lwa viga enga watumwa. <verse eid="ECC 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 10:8" />Akusimba bome adaha engila mwenye, akubogozola chiwambaza adaha alumwe ni nyoka. <verse eid="ECC 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 10:9" />Akutula mayuwe alumizwa ni mayuwe, akusenga nkuni zadaha zimlumize. <verse eid="ECC 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 10:10" />Uneva hoya ni filifinte, wajeseza nguvu zitendese mo kukanta, mna kujeseza ubala kwamtenda mntu achumilwe. <verse eid="ECC 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 10:11" />Mntu adaha atende na zindiko dya nyoka ina usungu utendese, mna inakonga kumluma zindiko dyakwe hazimwambize. <verse eid="ECC 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 10:12" />Milosi ya mta ubala yamwambiza yudya akuilonga, mna milosi ya mhezi yambalanga mwenye. <verse eid="ECC 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 10:13" />Mhezi akonga kulonga kwa milosi yo uhezi, na kubindiliza kwa ubwalasi wihise. <verse eid="ECC 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 10:14" />Mhezi alongesa milosi. Mntu hamanyize icho nachilaile nyumani, hegu icho nachilaile umo yeye anabanika. <verse eid="ECC 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 10:15" />Ndima ya mhezi yamsokeza mwenye, hamanyize isila yo kuwiya kwe kaya yakwe. <verse eid="ECC 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 10:16" />Isi naingile mwe nkunto uneva chilongozi ywakwe ni mbwanga mdodo, ne vilongozi wakwe wadamanya ngasu mazuwa yose. <verse eid="ECC 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 10:17" />Mjimbikwa nyuwe wantu we isi, chilongozi ywenyu ni mntu akutunywa, ne vilongozi wenyu wadamanya ngasu chipindi chiwagile, vileke watende na nguvu mna suko kukolwa. <verse eid="ECC 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 10:18" />Uneva mntu ni mbwa idihala dye inyumba yakwe dyabwatagala, uneva anatenda mbwa inyumba yadoda. <verse eid="ECC 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ECC 10:19" />Ngasu ya nkande ni kwachausa cha kwebwedeza na divai yasangalaza ujima, mna hela yagula ivyo vyose vidi. <verse eid="ECC 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ECC 10:20" />Usekumfuzumila seuta hata kwa fanyanyi du, hegu kumfuzumila mgoli kwe ichumba chako ukugona, kwaviya wadege wakupuluka wadaha weve ukalonga niyo wakuwagambila viya ulongile.<verse eid="ECC 10:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ECC 11" />
  <para style="s">Ivyo akudamanya mta ubala</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 11:1" />Wenke wantu watuhu vintu vyako kwa chisekwesekwe unadamanya ivyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 11:1">vyadahika nyumani novipate vituhu.<verse eid="ECC 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 11:2" />Wapangile vintu vyako wantu mfungate hegu mnane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 11:2">kwaviya humanyize ni buli dyani nadilaile mwe isi. Wantu awo wadaha weze wakwambize.<verse eid="ECC 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 11:3" />Amaingu yana mema mazi, fula yanya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 11:3">Mti unagwela ntendele ya kwamwenyemzi hegu ntendele ya chenya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 11:3">ahadya naugwele naho naugone.<verse eid="ECC 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 11:4" />Akugoja msimu hahande mbeyu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 11:4">akugoja amaingu yosike halozole chochose.<verse eid="ECC 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 11:5" />Hachimanyize ivyo mpeho ikuvumila na uko ikuhinga, seivyo hachimanyize ivyo ujima ukwingila mwe mavuha ya mwana mwe inda ya nine,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 11:5">ivyo hodahe kumanya ntendwa za Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 11:5">uyo akudamanya chila chintu.<verse eid="ECC 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 11:6" />Handa mbeyu mtondo na chisingi handa vituhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 11:6">kwaviya humanyize izo nazihote,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 11:6">ni za mtondo hegu za chisingi hegu zose nazitende zedi.<verse eid="ECC 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 11:7" />Ulangazi ni wedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 11:7">na mntu kuwona zuwa dikatontomoka kwawagila.<verse eid="ECC 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 11:8" />Mntu anekala mihilimo ilozize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 11:8">ayelelwe imihilimo iyo yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 11:8">mna akumbuke kugamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 11:8">mazuwa ya nkunto nayatende yalozesa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 11:8">na vyose navitimile ni vyabule.<verse eid="ECC 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwalangiliza wabwanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 11:9" />We mbwanga, elelwa umo wichei mbwanga mdodo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 11:9">umoyo wako usangale umo uchei mbwanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 11:9">Timila viya umoyo wako ukunga na uhelo wa ameso yako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 11:9">Mna ukumbuke kugamba Chohile nakukantile kuligana na ivyo vyose ukudamanya.<verse eid="ECC 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 11:10" />Elo, usa nkama mo umoyo wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 11:10">kwechinde usekupata ulumi mo umwili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 11:10">kwaviya ubwanga na udumo wo ujima ni vyabule.<verse eid="ECC 11:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ECC 12" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 12:1" />Mkumbuke Mumbi ywako amazuwa yo ubwanga wako, mazuwa ya nkunto heyenati kwiza, hegu heinati kusogela imihilimo nogambe, “Miye ujima sikuvyelelwa vituhu.” <verse eid="ECC 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 12:2" />Umkumbuke hechinati chipindi cho ulangazi we idizuwa no umnenge ne izintondo hevinati kukomela chiza mwako, na amaingu yasita vituhu fula ize inye. <verse eid="ECC 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 12:3" />Chipindi icho imikono ya awamizi we inyumba naizingize, ne iviga vya wata nguvu navitigintike, ameno yako yo kutafunila hayakudaha kwaviya ni majeche, na ameso yako hayawone vyedi. <verse eid="ECC 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 12:4" />Chipindi magutwi ywako yasita, chipindi wantu wakenulwa ni maizwi ya wadege, na maizwi ya kusaga nayafifiye, mna izinchemo zawo weye hozive. <verse eid="ECC 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 12:5" />Chipindi nawogohe kukwela hantu henukile, naho nowogohe kujenda mwesila, umo unadalahala fili zako nazing'ale fii chwee, nosokele kujenda saviya halala, hotende na nkwina vituhu. Udumo chose chabanika na kwita kowikazi wa kale na kale, na wakulomboleza wakazunguluka mwe chijiji. <verse eid="ECC 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 12:6" />Mkumbuke Mumbi ywako uchei mbwanga kwaviya zuwa dimwenga ujima wako naubule udumo, notende saviya mnyolo wa chumbu ukukantika, saviya makuli dya zahabu ditulike, naho saviya biga dya mazi ditulike, saviya sigi ya nkosi ikantikile mwe sima. <verse eid="ECC 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 12:7" />Imili yetu nayuye mwe idilumbi umo ilavigwe, ne iloho yako naimuwiye Chohile ayumbile. <verse eid="ECC 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 12:8" />Miye mlongi nagamba ni vyabule, chila chintu ni chabule.<verse eid="ECC 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Milosi yo udumo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 12:9" />Ukaleka ubala ananawo, Mlongi kawahinya wantu umanyi. Kaihima na kuhina milongi, na kuika kwa untanda imilongi iyo. <verse eid="ECC 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 12:10" />Mlongi kazuzisa vileke apate milosi iligane, na chila awandike chendaga chiligana na cha chindedi. <verse eid="ECC 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 12:11" />Milosi ya wantu wata ubala ni saviya nkome ina mbulo ya kuwogoila wanyama wakudimwa, na milongi yawo nisaviya mitunga itungigwe mwe mti. <verse eid="ECC 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 12:12" />Ukaleka ayo mwanangu, zumila kulangilizwa. Kwaviya kuwandika vitabu hakukusila, na kusomesa kwasokeza umwili. <verse eid="ECC 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 12:13" />Yose ayo yalongigwe yanaheza, kuna chintu chimwenga chikungwa, mtunye Chohile na kutimila imiko yakwe, kwaviya icho nicho aumbilwe mntu. <verse eid="ECC 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 12:14" />Kwaviya Chohile nachikantile kuligana ne izintendwa zetu zose, hata ziya chikutenda chinyele, zitende ni zedi hegu ziha.<verse eid="ECC 12:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 12" />
</usx>